// Copy to Signing.local.xcconfig in this folder (gitignored) to sign local builds with your own
// certificate. A stable identity keeps Rote's Accessibility grant across rebuilds; without this
// file builds are signed ad hoc and lose it. List your identities with:
//   security find-identity -v -p codesigning
// Use the identity's name ("Developer ID Application" or "Apple Development" picks the one of
// that kind for the team) and the 10-character team ID shown in parentheses after it.

CODE_SIGN_IDENTITY = Developer ID Application
DEVELOPMENT_TEAM = <your team ID>
